              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword and shield. May have javelins (+1 pt) and light armour (+2 pts). Subject to Warband psychology. (Armies of Antiquity p.9)</characteristic>
